;;;782    /**
;;;783     * Fills the supplied mbuf with the variable length Information Data field of a
;;;784     * Find Information ATT response.
;;;785     *
;;;786     * @param req                   The Find Information request being responded
;;;787     *                                  to.
;;;788     * @param om                    The destination mbuf where the Information
;;;789     *                                  Data field gets written.
;;;790     * @param mtu                   The ATT L2CAP channel MTU.
;;;791     * @param format                On success, the format field of the response
;;;792     *                                  gets stored here.  One of:
