;;;1053   
;;;1054   /**
;;;1055    * Searches the main proc list for an entry whose connection handle and op code
;;;1056    * match those specified.  If a matching entry is found, it is removed from the
;;;1057    * list and returned.
;;;1058    *
;;;1059    * @param conn_handle           The connection handle to match against.
;;;1060    * @param rx_entries            The array of rx entries corresponding to the
;;;1061    *                                  op code of the incoming response.
;;;1062    * @param out_rx_entry          On success, the address of the matching rx
;;;1063    *                                  entry is written to this pointer.
;;;1064    *
;;;1065    * @return                      The matching proc entry on success;
